# Data
# M10 Phase 1 (PoseNet training data, scripts/generate_posenet_data.py):
# ignore the bulk generated images/labels but keep dataset_meta.json tracked
# (sample count, seed, ranges, mujoco version, scene checksum -- the
# reproducibility record). Narrowed from a blanket `data/` (M01) to these two
# subdirectories specifically so dataset_meta.json is not swept up with them.
data/posenet/images/
data/posenet/labels/
*.mp4
*.avi

# Ad hoc probe/debug render output (scripts/probe_render.py); committed render
# evidence lives under docs/images/ instead, named per module.
out_probe.png
out/

# Hugging Face cache
.cache/

